# Stillwater Terraces - the fifth island of the library's plan The Lullaby Frequency (SL1, horror)
# A green hill climbed by three flooded rice terraces (shallow water of Raft's grey plates, tinted green, on each level)
# and an altar terrace on top: a stone platform on pillars with a shrine wall, a piano bench and a gong, its stair laid
# only when the three Bell stones are set in their stand. Twelve robed figures (Tangaroa's founder statue, small, heads
# down) mourn in the paddies - there three times over, one set shown at a time: as you climb they stand closer each
# time you look up, and at the top they all face the sea. Quest "The Planting Song" (10 steps): paddy 1, the planting
# song, paddy 2, the three Bell stones (the plan's WHEN for Mistlock Causeway: step 4), paddy 3 (fog; two grey bears
# push through the paddies), the Bell stone stand, the bears, the monk's confession, the offering box, the altar.
# RESIZE + DEEP 10-25 (deep pass, The Lullaby Frequency): Radius 63 -> 85, as big as Raft's own big islands; the terraces
# and the altar stay in the middle, the path runs on down to the south beach. New: Hermit's Peak in the north-east (a
# 32 m climb to the abbot's ruined hermitage; the offering box's key is up there, so the box only opens once you have
# climbed it), the monks' seed store drowned in a deep hole off the west shore (an air pocket; a planter's note), the
# ossuary cave in the south-west, a crashed plane in the south-east, two buried treasures (one with titanium). Quest
# 10 -> 16 steps, the new ones after step 7 (the plan's WHEN for Mistlock Causeway stays step 4, its done-when the altar).
# Voices: Abbot Oren Vasque, planter Noor Hadi, Brother Ivo.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe stillwater_terraces) through the editor's own operations.
include lib_sea
include lib_features
include lib_areas
include lib_highwater
new
# (nature: tropical on the lower slopes, Like Raft - the terraces cleared)
gen Trees=0.3 Bushes=0.3 Rocks=0.43 Harvest=0.3 BeachThings=0.35
gen Seed=1205 Radius=85 Height=18 Roughness=0.3 Peaks=1 Shape=0 Style=0 PeakShape=0.4 Cliffs=0.1 BeachWidth=0.6
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.5 SeaFinds=0.5 Sunken=0.3 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0.15 SeaLife=0.35
generate

# --- Terrain: four terraces climbing north (3, 7, 11 m and the altar's 15 m, 16 m apart), a path up the middle -------
brush flatten from -20 -38 to 20 -38 r=8 s=20 frames=400 h=3
brush flatten from -20 -22 to 20 -22 r=8 s=20 frames=400 h=7
brush flatten from -20 -6 to 20 -6 r=8 s=20 frames=400 h=11
brush flatten from -14 12 to 14 12 r=9 s=20 frames=400 h=15
# (the path up the middle: a ramp of pads at each terrace edge, 4 m up over 10 m, then smoothed)
# (10-25: pads 0.5 m apart and 5 m wide - the 3 m ramp left steps the walker caught on at z -33 and -15)
# (later 10-25: each pad a 0.5 m-wide line across the ramp - round pads 2.5 m wide set each spot to the highest pad over
# it, which left a 1 m step at the ramp's foot; the walker stuck at z -33 again)
for k 0 10 0.5
brush flatten from -2.5 {-35+$k} to 2.5 {-35+$k} r=0.5 s=20 frames=150 h={3+0.4*$k}
brush flatten from -2.5 {-19+$k} to 2.5 {-19+$k} r=0.5 s=20 frames=150 h={7+0.4*$k}
brush flatten from -2.5 {-6+$k} to 2.5 {-6+$k} r=0.5 s=20 frames=150 h={11+0.4*$k}
next
brush smooth from 0 -48 to 0 5 r=2.5 s=4 frames=20
# --- DEEP 10-25 terrain: the path on down to the south beach, Hermit's Peak (north-east, summit 32 m, base r 24) and
# its path, the seed store's hole (west, -14 m); the cave's, the plane's and the hermitage's pads come with their macros
brush smooth from 0 -48 to 0 -84 r=3 s=6 frames=40
call hw_mount x=40 z=45 b=24 h=32
call hw_trail x=40 z=45 b=24 h=32 a0=221.63 turn=300 n=38 h0=12
brush flatten at 40 45 r=9 s=20 frames=400 h=32
call hw_basin x=-80 z=-10 r=14 h=-14
origin
clear from -22 -38 to 22 -38 r=9
clear from -22 -22 to 22 -22 r=9
clear from -22 -6 to 22 -6 r=9
clear from -16 12 to 16 12 r=10
clear from 0 -56 to 0 -40 r=3
clear from 0 -84 to 0 -56 r=3
call ar_cave x=-45 z=-62 h=4 yaw=0 al=ossuaryrock chest=ossuarychest
call ar_plane x=56 z=-40 h=4 yaw=300 al=wreckplane crate=planecrate
call ar_ruin x=40 z=45 h=32 yaw=0 w=3 d=2 al=hermitage

# --- The paddies: on each terrace two fields of shallow water (grey plates 3 m, tinted), either side of the path ---
macro paddy zc=-38 h=3
push at 0 $zc h=$h
for px -12 -3 3
place Block_Floor_Tier3 paddywater at $px -1.5 y=0.08 sx=1.86 sz=1.86
place Block_Floor_Tier3 paddywater at $px 1.5 y=0.08 sx=1.86 sz=1.86
place Block_Floor_Tier3 paddywater at {0-$px} -1.5 y=0.08 sx=1.86 sz=1.86
place Block_Floor_Tier3 paddywater at {0-$px} 1.5 y=0.08 sx=1.86 sz=1.86
next
place VP_BrickStack01 - at -19 -2 y=0 sit yaw=90
place VP_BrickStack02 - at 19 1 y=0 sit yaw=270
pop
end
call paddy zc=-38 h=3
call paddy zc=-22 h=7
call paddy zc=-6 h=11

# --- The mourners: twelve small founder statues, heads down, on the dry strip behind the paddies - three sets -------
# st_a: on the altar terrace's front, facing down the hill (shown at the start)
# st_b: on terrace 3's back strip, facing the sea (shown from paddy 2 on, and again at the altar)
# st_c: on terrace 2's back strip, facing up the hill - behind you (shown from paddy 3 on)
# (st_a from the fourth on: the altar terrace's west end falls away to the sea)
# (not the seventh and eleventh: x 1.6 sits on the path's ramp, x 14.4 on the terrace's falling east end)
for i 3 5
place TangaroaFounderStatue st_a at {-17.6+3.2*$i} 5 ground sit yaw=180 scale=0.4
next
for i 7 9
place TangaroaFounderStatue st_a at {-17.6+3.2*$i} 5 ground sit yaw=180 scale=0.4
next
place TangaroaFounderStatue st_a at 17.6 5 ground sit yaw=180 scale=0.4
for i 0 11
place TangaroaFounderStatue st_b at {-17.6+3.2*$i} -1 ground sit yaw=180 scale=0.4
place TangaroaFounderStatue st_c at {-17.6+3.2*$i} -17 ground sit yaw=0 scale=0.4
next

# --- The marker with the planting song; the three Bell stones; the stand; the fog; the bears ----------------------
place Note_Sign plantingsong at 2.6 -42.5 ground sit yaw=180
place Zone_Trigger paddy1 at 0 -40 ground y=1
place Zone_Trigger paddy2 at 0 -24 ground y=1
place Zone_Trigger paddy3 at 0 -8 ground y=1
place Placeable_Brick_Wet bellstone1 at 16.5 -42 ground sit scale=2.2
place Placeable_Brick_Wet bellstone2 at -16.5 -26 ground sit scale=2.2 yaw=40
place Placeable_Brick_Wet bellstone3 at 16.5 -10 ground sit scale=2.2 yaw=80
place Bench_01 bellstand at 2.8 -10 ground sit yaw=270
place Zone_Atmosphere terracefog at 0 -6 ground y=2
place Creature_Bear bears at -8 -6 ground y=0.5

# --- The altar: a stone platform 9 x 4.5 m on pillars (2.42 m), the shrine wall at its back, its stair (hidden) -----
push at -4.5 8 h=15
for fx 0.75 8.25 1.5
for fz 0.75 3.75 1.5
place Block_Floor_Tier3 - at $fx $fz y=2.42
next
next
for px 0 9 1.5
place Block_Pillar_Tier3 - at $px 0 y=0
place Block_Pillar_Tier3 - at $px 4.5 y=0
next
for wx 0.75 8.25 1.5
place Block_Wall_Tier3 - at $wx 4.5 y=2.42
next
place Block_Stair_Tier3 altarstair at 4.5 -1.535 y=0 sit centred yaw=0
place Note_Sign confession at 6.5 4.1 y=2.42 sit yaw=180
place Loot_Chest offeringbox at 2.4 3.8 y=2.42 sit yaw=180
place Bench_01 - at 4.5 3.2 y=2.42 sit yaw=180
place Antenna_dish - at 7.8 2 y=2.42 sit scale=1.6
place Placeable_Lantern_Metal fogcam at 4.5 0.4 y=2.42 sit
place Zone_Trigger altar at 4.5 2 y=3.4
pop
place Zone_Trigger foglook at 0 -105 y=1

# --- Things to gather, two reefs off the beaches ----------------------------------------------------------------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Mango" 2 at 0 0 r=52 seed=1251 free=5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_PineappleLandmark" 2 at 0 0 r=52 seed=1252 free=5
call dirt x=-34 z=24 r=9 n=2 seed=1253
call shallows r=96 deep=5 n=3 seed=1254
call hw_reef x=-88 z=-2 r=3 seed=30301
call hw_reef x=-88 z=-18 r=3 seed=30302

# --- DEEP 10-25: Hermit's Peak - its foot and top as zones, the abbot's ruined hermitage on top (the offering box key) ---
call hw_zone x=23.39 z=26.31 al=hillfootz id=hillfoot r=5 msg="Hermit's Peak. Steps cut into the slope wind up to a ruin on the top. Up there someone is humming the planting song."
call hw_zone x=40 z=45 al=hilltopz id=hilltop r=8 h=1 msg="The top of Hermit's Peak, and the abbot's hermitage, its roof gone. Nobody here. The humming stops as you come in."
place Note_Paper abbotnote at 39.25 45 h=33.1 drop yaw=10
place Loot_Chest hermitchest at 41.3 45.5 h=32.1 drop yaw=180
loot hermitchest story:shrinekey*1;Rope*2;Candle*2;Cooked_Mackerel*1
note hermitchest Hermit's chest | The abbot's chest in the ruin: rope, candles, dried fish - and a little bronze key wrapped in a leaf: OFFERING BOX.
prop hermitchest loot.refill=0
place Zone_Sound peakhum at 40 45 h=34
prop peakhum sound.event=event:/raft/radar/radar_humm
prop peakhum sound.volume=0.35
prop peakhum zone.radius=12
scatter Bush 6 at 40 45 r=24 seed=30303 free=1
scatter Bush2 4 at 40 45 r=24 seed=30304 free=1
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Rock 1" 3 at 40 45 r=24 seed=30305 free=2
place Creature_Goat hillgoats at 26.39 29.31 ground
prop hillgoats creature.count=2
# --- The monks' seed store (west), drowned in a hole 14 m down, an air pocket: Noor's note, the back room's chest -------
call hw_sunkhouse x=-80 z=-10 h=-14 yaw=0 a=seedstore chest=seedchest air=seedair bub=seedbub dal=seeddoor
call hw_zone x=-80 z=-10 al=seedzone id=seedstore r=7 h=1 msg="The monks' seed store, 14 m down. Sacks of seed rice burst open along the walls. Its front room still holds air."
place Note_Paper noornote at -79.4 -12.2 h=-13.7 drop yaw=20
loot seedchest Seed_Strawberry*2;Rope*2;MetalIngot*1;Nail*6
prop seedchest loot.refill=0
note seedchest Seed store chest | The planters' chest: seeds that never went into the paddies, rope, nails and an iron ingot.
place Creature_PufferFish seedpuffers at -72 -4 h=-9
prop seedpuffers creature.count=2
# --- The ossuary cave (south-west): a secret ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
call hw_zone x=-45 z=-57 al=cavez id=ossuary r=4 msg="The monks' ossuary cave. Niches cut in the rock, and in every niche a little straw figure where the bones should be."
place Note_Paper ivonote at -43.5 -56.5 h=4.45 drop yaw=0
loot ossuarychest Candle*2;Scrap*2;MetalOre*2;Battery*1
prop ossuarychest loot.refill=0
note ossuarychest Ossuary box | Brother Ivo's box: candles, a battery, scrap and ore from the cave's back wall.
call treasure x=-51 z=-52 r=14 n=1 seed=30306 kind=0
prop treasure30306 treasure.loot=TitaniumOre*2;Scrap*2;Bolt*2
# --- The crashed plane (south-east): a secret ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
loot planecrate Plastic*3;Rope*2;CopperIngot*1;Battery*1
prop planecrate loot.refill=0
note planecrate Plane's crate | A mail plane's crate: plastic, rope, a battery and a copper ingot. The mail sacks are full of letters to the terraces, unopened.
call treasure x=62 z=-32 r=14 n=1 seed=30307 kind=0
prop treasure30307 treasure.loot=MetalOre*3;CopperOre*2;Hinge*1

# --- Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest ----------------------------------------------------------------
info title=Stillwater Terraces
info author=Custom Islands
info description=Flooded rice terraces climbing a green hill to an altar, and twelve robed figures mourning in the paddies, on an island as big as Raft's own big islands: Hermit's Peak and its ruined hermitage, a seed store drowned off the shore, the ossuary cave, a crashed mail plane. The fifth island of The Lullaby Frequency.
island on.arrive=message||Terraces of still water, one above the other, and figures standing in them. None of them moves. The water does not move either.

story bellstone|Bell stone|Placeable_Brick_Wet|A smooth grey stone that rings like a bell when you knock it. Three of them belong in the stand on the third terrace.
story shrinekey|Offering box key|Placeable_Lantern_Metal|A little bronze key wrapped in a leaf, from the abbot's hermitage on Hermit's Peak.
story bellsset|Bell stones set|Placeable_Brick_Wet|The three Bell stones sit in their stand. The altar's stair is laid.

note plantingsong Planting song | THE PLANTING SONG\n(sung in the paddies, slow, one line to each step)\n\nmi - re - do,  mi - re - do,\nso - fa - mi - re - mi...\n\nHush now, the water is listening.\n\n(Under it, cut later, deeper: DO NOT SING IT AT NIGHT)
note confession Monk's confession | I taught them the planting song. I did not write it. It came over the water one night at twelve past three and I wrote it down as it came.\n\nThey sang it in the paddies and the rice grew as it never had. Then they sang it at night, and stood still in the water, and did not come in.\n\nI made the statues so there would be someone in the paddies when the song came. Forgive me. Follow the lamps to the causeway; the Choir went that way.\n\nThe offering box is locked. I sent its key up to the abbot at the hermitage on Hermit's Peak, so that I could not open it and give the song anything more.
note abbotnote Abbot Oren Vasque's letter | TO WHOEVER CLIMBS UP - O. VASQUE, ABBOT\n\nBrother Tamsin sent me the offering box key and a note asking me to keep it from him. I did not understand why until the first night up here.\n\nFrom the peak you can see all three paddies at once. At 3:12 every planter is standing in the water with their face turned up to the altar, and the water round their knees is perfectly still, though the sea below is rough.\n\nI came up to pray. I find I have been humming instead. My hands keep the time on the table without me.\n\nThe figures were not here when I came up. Now there is one at the door every morning, a little closer. I have stopped going out.\n\nTake the key. Open the box. Give back what we gave her, and do not sing.
note noornote Planter Noor Hadi's note | (Pencil on a seed bag, dry in the air pocket)\n\nWe planted the low paddy singing, the way the brother taught us, and the rice came up so fast you could watch it.\n\nThe night the sea took the store I was down here counting sacks. The water came in under the door as quiet as milk, and I did not run, because I could hear the song in it, and it was so kind.\n\nI am in the air under the roof. Through the window I can see the shore, and the planters coming down off the terraces one by one, walking into the sea in their wet clothes, heads down, the way the statues stand.\n\nThey are walking east, towards a fog with lamps in it.\n\nTell my sister not to plant this year.
note ivonote Brother Ivo's note | BROTHER IVO - THE OSSUARY\n\nWe keep the bones of the order here, in the niches, as we always have. This morning every niche had a little straw doll in it instead, the kind the Choir makes on the sandbars, each with a scrap of a brother's robe for clothes.\n\nThe bones are not anywhere. I have looked.\n\nI think the dolls were brought by the sea. The floor of the cave is wet to the ankle and the tide does not come in this far.\n\nI have put my own robe on the last empty niche, so that whatever is collecting us will not need to come and measure me.\n\nIf you hear singing from the back wall, it is not me.
note offeringbox Offering box | The monks' offering box: a fishing rod, a lantern, rice cakes wrapped in leaves (long since gone to dust), dried fish.
loot offeringbox FishingRod_Metal*1;Placeable_Lantern_Basic*1;Cooked_Mackerel*3;Coconut*2
prop offeringbox loot.refill=0
prop offeringbox if.open=has|story:shrinekey|1
prop offeringbox else.open=message||The offering box is locked. The monk's confession says its key went up to the abbot's hermitage on Hermit's Peak.

prop paddywater tint.color=#55715a
prop paddywater tint.amount=0.8

prop st_a obj.name=st_a
prop st_b obj.name=st_b
prop st_b beh.hidden=1
prop st_c obj.name=st_c
prop st_c beh.hidden=1

prop paddy1 zone.id=paddy1
prop paddy1 zone.radius=5
prop paddy1 zone.message=The figures stand up on the top terrace, heads down. Twelve of them.
prop paddy2 zone.id=paddy2
prop paddy2 zone.radius=5
prop paddy2 zone.repeat=never
prop paddy2 on.enter=hide|st_a\nshow|st_b\nplaysound||event:/amb/wreck_creaks|0.7|once|near\nmessage||You look up. They are on the terrace just above you now.
prop paddy3 zone.id=paddy3
prop paddy3 zone.radius=5
prop paddy3 zone.repeat=never
prop paddy3 on.enter=hide|st_b\nshow|st_c\nshow|terracefog\nmessage||Fog comes down over the water - and behind you, below, something big is pushing through the paddies. The figures are behind you too.
prop terracefog obj.name=terracefog
prop terracefog beh.hidden=1
prop terracefog atmo.fog=#b9c2bd
prop terracefog atmo.fogAmount=0.65
prop terracefog atmo.light=#9aa6a0
prop terracefog atmo.lightAmount=0.4
prop terracefog atmo.particles=mist
prop terracefog zone.radius=34
prop bears creature.count=2
prop bears creature.respawn=0
prop bears creature.zone=paddy3
prop bears creature.health=3
prop bears creature.size=1.2
prop bears tint.color=#8c8c8c
prop bears tint.amount=0.8

prop bellstone1 obj.name=bellstone1
prop bellstone2 obj.name=bellstone2
prop bellstone3 obj.name=bellstone3
prop bellstone1 beh.use=Take the Bell stone
prop bellstone2 beh.use=Take the Bell stone
prop bellstone3 beh.use=Take the Bell stone
prop bellstone1 on.use=hide|\ngive||story:bellstone*1\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever\nmessage||The stone rings under your knuckle, faint and clear.
prop bellstone2 on.use=hide|\ngive||story:bellstone*1\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever\nmessage||The stone rings under your knuckle, faint and clear.
prop bellstone3 on.use=hide|\ngive||story:bellstone*1\nsound||event:/raft/radar/lever\nmessage||The stone rings under your knuckle, faint and clear.
prop bellstand obj.name=bellstand
prop bellstand beh.use=Set the Bell stones in the stand
prop bellstand if.use=take|story:bellstone|3
prop bellstand on.use=give||story:bellsset*1\nshow|altarstair\nplaysound||event:/crafting/horns/viking|0.6|once|near\nmessage||Three notes ring out together. Up on the altar terrace, stone grinds on stone: a stair.
prop bellstand else.use=message||Three hollows in the bench, worn smooth. Three stones belong here.
prop altarstair obj.name=altarstair
prop altarstair beh.hidden=1

prop fogcam obj.name=fogcam
prop foglook obj.name=foglook
prop foglook zone.radius=1
prop altar zone.id=altar
prop altar zone.radius=3
prop altar zone.repeat=never
prop altar on.enter=hide|st_c\nshow|st_b\ncamera|fogcam|foglook|6|40\nmessage||Below you every figure has turned to face the sea. Out there a fog bank lies on the water, and lamps burn in it, in a line.

quest title=The Planting Song
quest intro=Flooded terraces and a path up the middle. Climb to the first paddy.
step reach|paddy1|1|Walk up to the first paddy
step read|Planting song|1|Read the planting song on the wooden marker
step reach|paddy2|1|Climb to the second paddy
step collect|story:bellstone|3|Find the three Bell stones on the terraces
step reach|paddy3|1|Climb to the third paddy
step collect|story:bellsset|1|Set the Bell stones in their stand
step kill|Bear|2|Deal with what came up through the paddies
step read|Monk's confession|1|Read the monk's confession at the shrine wall
step reach|hillfoot|1|Find the path up Hermit's Peak in the north-east
step reach|hilltop|1|Climb Hermit's Peak to the abbot's hermitage
step read|Abbot Oren Vasque's letter|1|Read the abbot's letter in the hermitage
step collect|story:shrinekey|1|Take the offering box key from the hermit's chest
step reach|seedstore|1|Dive to the drowned seed store off the west shore
step read|Planter Noor Hadi's note|1|Breathe in the seed store's front room and read the planter's note
step open|Offering box|1|Open the offering box
step reach|altar|1|Stand at the altar
quest done=They face the sea now, all of them. Out in the fog bank a line of lamps - a causeway. The Receiver crackles; tune it when it settles.
quest reward=MetalIngot*4;TitaniumIngot*1

save Stillwater Terraces
